00:07:45.610 --> 00:07:47.310
I have a problem high-fiving now.

00:07:47.310 --> 00:07:48.143
In Kmart?

00:07:48.143 --> 00:07:48.976
You won't high five?

00:07:48.976 --> 00:07:49.891
A low five.
Laverne, will you

00:07:49.891 --> 00:07:50.724
high five me?

00:07:50.724 --> 00:07:51.557
Do you know what low five is?

00:07:51.557 --> 00:07:52.390
Sure enough will.

00:07:52.390 --> 00:07:53.223
(hands slap)

00:07:53.223 --> 00:07:54.056
She high-fives me.

00:07:54.056 --> 00:07:54.889
Try it. Come on.

00:07:54.889 --> 00:07:55.814
You might like it.

00:07:55.814 --> 00:07:56.647
(hands smack)

00:07:56.647 --> 00:07:57.480
You just high fived in Kmart.

00:07:57.480 --> 00:07:58.313
I didn't like it.

00:07:58.313 --> 00:08:00.896
(upbeat music)

00:08:04.830 --> 00:08:06.825
(audience cheers)

00:08:06.825 --> 00:08:08.112
We're gonna take a little break.

00:08:08.112 --> 00:08:08.945
When we come back,

00:08:08.945 --> 00:08:09.841
Ice Cube is here!

00:08:09.841 --> 00:08:10.924
Stick around.

